{"speciesId":281,"names":{"fr":"Kirlia","es":"Kirlia","en":"Kirlia","ja":"キルリア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"It is said that a KIRLIA that is exposed to the positive emotions of its TRAINER grows beautiful. This POKéMON controls psychokinetic powers with its highly developed brain."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"KIRLIA uses the horns on its head to amplify its psychokinetic power. When the POKéMON uses its power, the air around it becomes distorted, creating mirages of nonexistent scenery."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A KIRLIA has the psychic power to create a rip in the dimensions and see into the future. It is said to dance with pleasure on sunny mornings."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The cheerful spirit of its TRAINER gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The cheerful spirit of its TRAINER gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is highly perceptive of its Trainer’s feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is highly perceptive of its Trainer’s feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il sent la joie de son Dresseur, il se met à danser, débordant d’énergie."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il sent la joie de son Dresseur, il se met à danser, débordant d’énergie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon tire ses pouvoirs psy du soutien de son Dresseur. Il danse et tourne sur lui-même quand il est content."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al percibir la alegría de su Entrenador refuerza sus ataques psicoquinéticos. Cuando está contento, da vueltas y baila."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The cheerful spirit of its Trainer gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"トレーナーの 明るい 気持ちが サイコパワーの 源。楽しい 気分に なると クルクル 踊る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut distordre l’espace-temps grâce à ses pouvoirs psy et ainsi voir l’avenir."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Con sus poderes psíquicos puede deformar el espacio a su alrededor y predecir el futuro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"サイコパワーを 操り まわりの 空間を ねじ曲げる ことで 未来を 見通す ことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On dit qu’un Kirlia exposé aux émotions positives de son Dresseur devient très beau. Le cerveau surdéveloppé de ce Pokémon lui permet de contrôler les forces télékinétiques."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dicen que, al recibir los sentimientos positivos de su Entrenador, Kirlia crece con gran belleza. Este Pokémon controla poderes psicoquinéticos gracias al desarrollado cerebro que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It is said that a Kirlia that is exposed to the positive emotions of its Trainer grows beautiful. This Pokémon controls psychokinetic powers with its highly developed brain."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"トレーナーの 明るい 感情に 触れている キルリアは 美しく 成長すると いう。 発達した 脳で サイコパワーを 操る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kirlia utilise ses cornes pour amplifier ses pouvoirs télékinétiques. Lorsque ce Pokémon utilise son pouvoir, l’air ambiant se déforme et crée des mirages de paysages qui n’existent pas."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kirlia usa los cuernos para amplificar los poderes de psicoquinesia que tiene. Cuando los usa, altera el ambiente, lo transforma y crea espejismos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kirlia uses the horns on its head to amplify its psychokinetic power. When the Pokémon uses its power, the air around it becomes distorted, creating mirages of nonexistent scenery."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭の ツノで 増幅された サイコパワーが 使われるとき 周りの 空間が ねじ曲がり 現実には ない 景色が 見えると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand il ressent la joie de son Dresseur, il déborde d’énergie et se met à danser en tournant sur lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Si su Entrenador está contento, desborda energía y baila alegremente dando giros."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"トレーナーが 喜ぶと キルリアに エネルギーが 満ちあふれ 楽しそうに くるくると 踊る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il peut distordre l’espace-temps grâce à ses pouvoirs psychiques et ainsi voir l’avenir."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Con sus poderes psíquicos puede deformar el espacio a su alrededor y predecir el futuro."},{"language":"en","version":